  "summary": "Adopted direct typed copied commands, truthful structural eligibility, provider-neutral menu semantics, shared server-safe formatting kits, source-derived install requirements and one atomic r/rd registry generation. Generated Base and Radix apps pass native command proof. The geometry candidate failed its frozen p95 gate and manual geometry remains production source.",
